---
import aiExample from '../generated/ai-example.txt?raw';
---
  <!-- ============ 10 · AI + MCP ============ -->
  <section data-section="ai" aria-labelledby="ai-h" style="position:relative; padding:90px 24px;">
    <div style="max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="max-width:720px;">
        <span style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:var(--acc); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:6px 12px; border-radius:30px; background:#fff;"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--acc2);">[</span> 10 &middot; EASY MODE <span aria-hidden="true" style="color:var(--acc2);">]</span></span>
        <h2 id="ai-h" class="flv-h2" style="font-family:'Sora',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:40px; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.08; margin:18px 0 0;">Or just say what you want.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:17.5px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--soft); margin:18px 0 0;"><span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono'; color:var(--acc); font-weight:600;">fluvie_ai</span> turns a plain sentence into a real <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono'; color:var(--acc); font-weight:600;">VideoSpec</span>. In the Playground, the AI Assistant writes editable Flutter-style Dart into the editor, so you can read it and refine it with another sentence. The model runs on the server, so the default flow keeps the provider key on that server. The MCP server in <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono'; color:var(--acc); font-weight:600;">fluvie_server</span> lets your assistant do the same from a chat. This is the optional easy mode, not the only mode.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flv-grid-3" style="margin-top:40px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:18px; align-items:stretch;">
        <!-- prompt -->
        <div style="border-radius:16px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; padding:22px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; box-shadow:0 18px 40px -30px rgba(11,16,32,0.2);">
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono'; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:12px;">1 &middot; the prompt</div>
          <div style="background:var(--grad); color:#fff; border-radius:14px 14px 14px 4px; padding:16px 18px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; box-shadow:0 12px 26px -14px rgba(22,104,227,0.5);">"A 10-second product promo, brand teal, a counter rising to 10,000."</div>
        </div>
        <!-- spec -->
        <div style="border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); background:#06070F; box-shadow:0 18px 40px -30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
          <div style="padding:14px 18px 0; font-family:'JetBrains Mono'; font-size:11px; color:var(--dmut);">2 &middot; editable Flutter code</div>
          <pre style="margin:0; padding:14px 18px 18px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; color:#CFE6FF; overflow:auto;">{aiExample}</pre>
        </div>
        <!-- film -->
        <div style="border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; box-shadow:0 18px 40px -30px rgba(11,16,32,0.2);">
          <div style="padding:14px 18px 10px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono'; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted);">3 &middot; actual Fluvie render</div>
          <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/promo.poster.png" aria-label="Ten-second Fluvie render of a counter rising to ten thousand on teal" style="display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; background:#0E9E8E;">
            <source src="/media/promo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
            <a href="/media/promo.mp4">Download the rendered video</a>
          </video>
          <p style="padding:0 18px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--soft);">This checked-in Dart produced the preview. Model output varies.</p>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; padding:0 18px 18px; font-size:13px;">
            <a href="/media/promo.dart">Full source</a>
            <a href="/media/promo.render.json">Render receipt</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p><a href="/authoring/">Inspect a real model run: prompts, Dart edits and verified videos</a></p>
      <div style="margin-top:24px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;">
        <a href="https://fluvie.dev/for-ai" style="text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:11px; background:var(--grad); color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px;" style-hover="transform:translateY(-1px);">Build with an AI assistant</a>
        <a href="https://docs.fluvie.dev/guides/ai-and-mcp" style="text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:11px; background:var(--grad); color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px;" style-hover="transform:translateY(-1px);">Read the AI &amp; MCP guide</a>
        <a href="https://demo.fluvie.dev" style="text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:11px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; font-size:14px;" style-hover="border-color:var(--acc); color:var(--acc);">Try it in the Playground <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:10px;">&#8599;</span></a>
        <a href="https://mcp.fluvie.dev" style="text-decoration:none; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:11px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; font-size:14px;" style-hover="border-color:var(--acc); color:var(--acc);">Hosted MCP <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:10px;">&#8599;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
